--
Fixed 2026-07-20: the arity-limited std::__and_/__or_ replacements
injected by cpp_internal_additions conflicted with the real definition
of the same name ([basic.def.odr]) -- resolution picked the injected
primary declaration and the alias default silently failed.  The front
end evaluates GCC 13's real decltype+SFINAE definitions now, so the
injection was retired.  remove_const_function_pointers.cpp converts
clean.
